PROGRAM hybrid_browser_quantum_demo
TASK search

INPUT query : QUERY

FIND pages : SET<PAGE> FROM web.index RELATED_TO query
FILTER verified : SET<PAGE> FROM pages BY verified_source
COMPUTE ranked : LIST<PAGE> USING semantic_rank INPUT verified query MODE AUTO
REQUIRE verified_source ON compute.ranked

TASK quantum_probe

QUANTUM BEGIN local_probe QUBITS 1000000 MODE RESULT_DIRECTED
GATE H q0
GATE CZ q0 q1
GATE CZ q1 q2
GATE CZ q2 q3
GATE CZ q3 q4
GATE CZ q4 q5
GATE CZ q5 q6
GATE CZ q6 q7
OBSERVE Z q7
QUANTUM END

OBSERVE probe_score : REAL FROM local_probe

TASK output
EFFECT render USING browser.render INPUT ranked probe_score REQUIRE user_authorization

RETURN ranked probe_score
